Package: xserver-xlibre-video-vesa
Architecture: any-amd64 any-i386
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${xviddriver:Depends},
Provides:
 xserver-xorg-video-vesa (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${xviddriver:Provides}
Description: XLibre X server -- VESA display driver
 This driver for the XLibre X server (see xserver-xlibre for a further description)
 uses the standard VESA interface provided on all video cards, but runs
 unaccelerated.  This driver is not recommended for use unless you have a
 problem with the normal driver for your card, because it will perform very
 badly.
 .
 More information about XLibre can be found at:
 <URL:https://github.com/X11Libre/xserver>
 .
 This package is built from the XLibre xf86-video-vesa driver module.
Conflicts:
 xserver-xorg-video-vesa,

